  sort_order, state, seo_title, seo_description) values
  ('godrej-vrikshya-sector-103-gurgaon', 'godrej-vrikshya-gurgaon-luxury-3-4-bhk-homes', 'Godrej Vrikshya', 'Eco-luxury residences wrapped around 800+ mature trees',
   'Godrej Properties', 'Dwarka Expressway', 'Sector 103', 'Gurugram',
   'residential', 'Apartment', 'under-construction', '3 & 4 BHK',
   36000000, 56600000, 14.86,
   6, 621, 'June 2031', 'RC/REP/HARERA/GGM/846/578/2024/73',
   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","Godrej Vrikshya Sector 103 Gurgaon is a premium upcoming residential project by Godrej Properties , offering elegant 3 and 4 BHK homes across a sprawling 14.86-acre site along the Dwarka Expressway. Comprising just 6 towers with approximately 621 luxury residences, Godrej Vrikshya Gurgaon ensures low-density, resort-style living.","Designed around over 800 mature trees, the project blends modern architecture with eco-friendly features, creating a serene, green environment. Spacious apartments and penthouses feature intelligent layouts, premium finishes, and panoramic views. With possession expected in June 2031, Godrej Vrikshya Sector 103 offers world-class amenities including infinity-edge swimming pools, squash and badminton courts, silent cinema zones, and landscaped gardens. Strategically located on the Dwarka Expressway with future metro connectivity, Godrej Vrikshya Gurgaon provides seamless access to Delhi, IGI Airport, and Gurgaon''s business hubs. Combining luxury, sustainability, and high investment potential, the project sets a benchmark for contemporary, eco-conscious living in New Gurgaon."}', '{"Located in Sector 103 Gurgaon on Dwarka Expressway.","Spanning 14.86 acres with 6 towers.","Offers 3 & 4 BHK apartments & penthouses.","Around 621 units ensure low-density living.","Over 800 existing trees integrated into design.","Resort-style infinity-edge & temperature-controlled pools."}', '{"include squash court & silent cinema.","RERA registered (RC/REP/HARERA/GGM/846/578/2024/73).","Expected possession: June 2031.","Developed by the trusted Godrej Properties.","Godrej Vrikshya Floors."}',
   '{"in this Project.","Investing in Godrej Vrikshya Sector 103 Gurgaon combines brand trust, premium living, and sustainable design.","The project features low-density planning, lush greenery, and resort-style amenities, making it perfect for families and investors.","Strategically located on the Dwarka Expressway, Godrej Vrikshya Gurgaon offers seamless connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, and key business hubs.","With thoughtfully designed 3 and 4 BHK apartments, eco-friendly features, and world-class facilities, Godrej Vrikshya Sector 103 provides an elevated lifestyle.","Developed by the trusted Godrej Properties.","Located on fast-developing Dwarka Expressway.","Premium amenities with sustainable infrastructure."}', '{"20 min to IGI Airport & Delhi via NH‑48.","Close to the upcoming Dwarka Metro.","Abundant green cover with a pollution-free environment.","Near hospitals, schools, and malls.","Access via Northern Peripheral Road.","Proximity to diplomatic enclave & ISBT Gurugram.","Excellent road infrastructure and upcoming metro corridor.","High potential for rental and capital appreciation."}', 'Thoughtfully crafted 3 BHK layouts (1,947 - 2,403 sq ft) with balanced space. Generous 4 BHK plans (3,700 sq ft) for upscale family living. Elegant penthouses with double-height ceilings and premium finishes.',
   '{"/projects/godrej-vrikshya-gurgaon-luxury-3-4-bhk-homes/02.jpg","/projects/godrej-vrikshya-gurgaon-luxury-3-4-bhk-homes/04.jpg"}', true, true, 0, 'published',
   'Godrej Vrikshya Sector 103 Gurgaon | Luxury 3 & 4 BHK Apartments | Floor Plans, Photos & Reviews', 'Discover Godrej Vrikshya Sector 103 Gurgaon - luxury 3/4 BHK homes with premium amenities. Explore photos, floor plans, brochures & latest reviews today!')
