  ('tulip-monsella-sector-53-gurgaon', 'tulip-monsella-sector-53-gurgaon-premium-3-4-bhk-apartments', 'Tulip Monsella', 'Ultra-luxury towers on Golf Course Road',
   'Tulip Infratech', 'Golf Course Road', 'Sector 53', 'Gurugram',
   'residential', 'Apartment', 'under-construction', '3, 4 & 5 BHK',
   114900000, 180100000, 20,
   null, 1383, null, null,
   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","Tulip Monsella Sector 53 is the epitome of luxury living in the heart of Gurgaon . Situated on the prestigious Golf Course Road , Tulip Monsella Gurgaon offers expansive 3, 4, and 5 BHK residences designed for comfort, elegance, and modern lifestyles. Spread across 20 acres of prime real estate, this premium residential enclave","combines contemporary architecture, green open spaces, and elite lifestyle amenities. Each home is thoughtfully crafted with precision, ensuring smart living, aesthetics, and superior comfort. The project''s strategic location, close to Rapid Metro, NH-8, and Cyber City, makes it one of the most sought-after luxury apartments Sector 53 Gurgaon offers. Backed by the reputed Tulip Group , the project ensures quality construction, timely possession, and world-class amenities. Ideal for families and investors, Tulip Monsella Golf Course Road presents a perfect blend of elegance, convenience, and strong investment potential."}', '{}', '{"Walking Distance to Rapid Metro Station.","70%+ Open Landscaped Area.","High-Speed Elevators & Concierge Desk.","Energy-Efficient & Vastu-Compliant Design.","Tulip Monsella."}',
   '{"in this Project.","Tulip Monsella Gurgaon offers a rare combination of luxury, prime location, and strong long-term value.","Strategically located on Golf Course Road , it addresses the rising demand for luxury apartments Sector 53 Gurgaon.","Prime Golf Course Road location.","Reputed Tulip Group development.","IGBC Gold Pre-Certification.","Excellent connectivity & metro access.","High rental yield & resale value."}', '{"Prime Dwarka Expressway location with Delhi & IGI Airport connectivity.","Modern 3, 4 BHK & Studio apartments with premium layouts.","Strong capital appreciation potential in Sector 104 Gurgaon.","World-class amenities like clubhouse, pool, and gym.","Eco-friendly design with green spaces and rainwater harvesting.","Trusted developer with timely delivery and quality construction.","Its prime location ensures easy access to corporate offices, shopping centers, schools, and healthcare facilities, making daily commutes convenient.","Surrounded by rapidly developing infrastructure, Central Park Sector 104 combines urban convenience with a tranquil living environment.","This makes it an ideal choice for families, professionals, and investors seeking both lifestyle and long-term appreciation."}', '3 BHK Layout: Thoughtfully designed with a spacious living-dining area and balcony for panoramic views. 4 BHK Layout: Includes dual-entry foyer, family lounge, and large bedrooms with attached baths. 5 BHK Layout: Grand spaces with double-height ceilings, expansive decks, and smart automation.',
   '{"/projects/tulip-monsella-sector-53-gurgaon-premium-3-4-bhk-apartments/03.webp","/projects/tulip-monsella-sector-53-gurgaon-premium-3-4-bhk-apartments/04.jpg"}', true, true, 1, 'published',
   'Tulip Monsella Sector 53 Gurgaon – Premium 3 & 4 BHK Apartments', 'Tulip Monsella Sector 53 is the epitome of luxury living in the heart of Gurgaon. Situated on the prestigious Golf Course Road, Tulip Monsella Gurgaon offers')
