   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","Smart World One DXP Sector 113 Gurgaon is a premium residential project strategically located along the Smart World One DXP Dwarka Expressway , on the Delhi-Gurgaon border. Developed by Smartworld Developers, this gated community seamlessly combines modern technology with elegant design to deliver a contemporary living experience. Spanning 16 acres, Smart World One DXP comprises high-rise towers featuring thoughtfully planned 2, 3, and 4 BHK apartments.","Each residence is equipped with smart home automation, VRV air conditioning, Italian marble flooring, and double-glazed windows, ensuring comfort and sophistication. Its prime location provides easy access to Delhi, IGI Airport, and the Diplomatic Enclave, making it ideal for urban professionals. The project also includes a 1.10 lakh sq. ft. clubhouse, co-working areas, fitness amenities, and luxurious recreational spaces. With its blend of technology, design, and connectivity, Smart World One DXP Gurgaon offers modern families a well-rounded, upscale lifestyle. Buyers can refer to the Smart World One DXP layout plan , floor plan , brochure , and price list for detailed insights."}', '{"Smartworld One DXP Sector 113 housing society has 8 towers with 29 floors.","There are around 900 units on offer.","The project is spread over an area of 16 acres.","Only 0 km away from the Delhi border.","Offering 2, 3, and 4 BHK ultra-modern residences.","24x7 co-working spaces available within the complex.","High-end home automation provided by Schneider.","A 1.10 lakh sq.","clubhouse featuring resort-like amenities.","Just 7 minutes from IGI Airport.","Designed by UHA London and Element Design Studio Singapore.","Double-glazed facade for effective sound insulation.","Modular kitchen equipped with European fittings.","Smart World One DXP."}', '{"Indoor gaming and leisure areas.","Temperature-regulated swimming pool.","Comprehensively equipped fitness center.","Small cinema and media room.","Yoga and meditation space.","Designed gardens and jogging paths.","Exclusive children''s play area.","Sky lounge and observation deck.","Round-the-clock power backup and security.","Private event terrace and barbecue areas.","Smart World One DXP."}',
   '{"in this Project.","Investing in Smart World One DXP Sector 113 Gurgaon provides an opportunity to own a home in one of the most prestigious areas along the Delhi-Gurgaon border.","Its contemporary design, RERA-compliant status, and flexible payment plans make Smart World One DXP Gurgaon ideal for both homeowners and investors.","Interested buyers can explore the Smart World One DXP layout plan , floor plan , price list , and brochure for complete details.","Prime Dwarka Expressway location with Delhi & IGI Airport connectivity.","Modern 3, 4 BHK & Studio apartments with premium layouts.","Strong capital appreciation potential in Sector 104 Gurgaon.","World-class amenities like clubhouse, pool, and gym."}', '{"0 KM from Delhi, providing direct access to the capital.","Just a 7-minute drive to IGI Airport.","In close proximity to the Diplomatic Enclave and Dwarka Sector 21.","Situated along the swiftly developing Dwarka Expressway.","An upcoming metro station is within walking distance.","Well-connected to NH-8 and significant corporate hubs.","Smart World One DXP Sector 113 Gurgaon is strategically located along the Smart World One DXP Dwarka Expressway , right at the Delhi-Gurgaon border.","This prime location ensures seamless access to Delhi, IGI Airport, and major business and diplomatic hubs.","Sector 113 is rapidly emerging as a preferred residential destination, surrounded by reputed schools, hospitals, shopping complexes, and metro connectivity.","Buyers can explore the Smart World One DXP layout plan , floor plan , price list , and brochure for detailed insights."}', 'Efficiently designed layouts for maximum space utilization Large balconies offering panoramic city views Master bedrooms with walk-in wardrobes and attached luxury bathrooms',
   '{"/projects/smart-world-one-dxp-sector-113-gurgaon/01.jpg","/projects/smart-world-one-dxp-sector-113-gurgaon/02.jpg","/projects/smart-world-one-dxp-sector-113-gurgaon/03.jpg","/projects/smart-world-one-dxp-sector-113-gurgaon/04.jpg","/projects/smart-world-one-dxp-sector-113-gurgaon/05.jpg","/projects/smart-world-one-dxp-sector-113-gurgaon/06.jpg","/projects/smart-world-one-dxp-sector-113-gurgaon/07.png","/projects/smart-world-one-dxp-sector-113-gurgaon/08.jpg"}', true, true, 3, 'published',
