   8, 866, '2026', null,
   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","Elan The Presidential is a luxury residential development by Elan Group , located in Sector 106, Gurgaon , along the prestigious Dwarka Expressway . This ultra-luxurious high-rise project offers carefully designed 3 BHK, 4 BHK, and 5 BHK residences that blend elegance, innovation, and smart living.","Each apartment features spacious balconies, smart home automation, premium fittings, and panoramic views of the city and green landscapes. Residents enjoy high-end amenities including a grand clubhouse, resort-style swimming pool, fitness centers, and wellness facilities, providing the perfect mix of comfort and sophistication. With excellent connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, and major employment hubs, Elan The Presidential is ideal for families, professionals, and investors seeking both a serene lifestyle and profitable real estate investment. With competitive pricing and innovative design, Elan The Presidential Dwarka Expressway stands as a premier destination for luxury living in Gurgaon."}', '{"Prime location on Dwarka Expressway.","Spacious 3, 4, and 5 BHK apartments.","The project is spread over an area of 12.76 acres.","There are around 866 units on offer.","Elan The Presidential Sector 106 housing society has 8 towers with 32 floors.","Eco-friendly and sustainable development.","Opulent clubhouse and recreational facilities.","Lush green spaces and landscaped gardens.","Smart home technologies.","Reputable developer with proven track record.","Elan The Presidential."}', '{"Children''s Play Area.","Swimming Pool.","Ample Parking.","Yoga & Meditation Center.","Jogging & Cycling Tracks.","Multipurpose Hall.","Cafeteria & Lounge.","24/7 Security.","Indoor Games Room.","Elan The Presidential."}',
   '{"in this Project.","Strategically positioned on the Dwarka Expressway, it ensures seamless connectivity to IGI Airport, Delhi, and major business hubs.","Developed by the reputed Elan Group , the project features smart homes, eco-friendly designs, and an array of world-class amenities.","Strategic Connectivity - Seamless access to Delhi, IGI Airport, and major commercial hubs via Dwarka Expressway.","Trusted Developer - Developed by Elan Group, renowned for luxury, innovation, and timely delivery.","Upscale Lifestyle - Resort-style amenities, wellness zones, and a premium clubhouse for elevated living.","Smart Home Features - Advanced automation and digital security systems for modern convenience.","Sustainable Living - Eco-friendly initiatives including solar power, rainwater harvesting, and green open spaces."}', '{"Just minutes from IGI Airport and Delhi, the project is surrounded by essential infrastructure including schools, hospitals, and commercial hubs.","The upcoming metro corridor and proximity to diplomatic enclaves further enhance accessibility and capital appreciation potentia l.","On Dwarka Expressway.","20 minutes from IGI Airport.","5 minutes to the upcoming metro station.","Easy access to Delhi & NH-8.","Near Cyber Hub and Udyog Vihar.","Close to Conscient One Mall.","Proximity to top schools and hospitals.","Near proposed Diplomatic Enclave."}', '3 BHK units ranging from 1347 to 2107 sq. ft. 4 BHK units ranging from 1692 to 2717 sq. ft. 5 BHK units ranging from 2283 to 3802 sq. ft.',
   '{"/projects/elan-the-presidential-gurgaon/02.jpg","/projects/elan-the-presidential-gurgaon/04.jpg","/projects/elan-the-presidential-gurgaon/05.jpg","/projects/elan-the-presidential-gurgaon/06.jpg","/projects/elan-the-presidential-gurgaon/07.webp","/projects/elan-the-presidential-gurgaon/08.jpg"}', true, true, 5, 'published',
   'Elan The Presidential Gurgaon', 'Elan The Presidential is a luxury residential development by Elan Group, located in Sector 106, Gurgaon, along the prestigious Dwarka Expressway. This')
