   'residential', 'Apartment', 'under-construction', '3, 4 & 5 BHK',
   45500000, 55400000, 7.13,
   5, 200, null, null,
   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","Hero Homes The Palatial , located in Sector 104, Gurugram , is a new luxury offering by Hero Realty that redefines upscale urban living. Designed with a perfect fusion of contemporary architecture and smart-home technology, the project features thoughtfully crafted 3 BHK and 4 BHK residences that exude elegance, comfort, and innovation. Strategically positioned along the rapidly developing Dwarka Expressway, The Palatial ensures seamless connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, and key business districts of Gurugram, making daily commutes effortless.","With a strong emphasis on holistic living, the development offers lifestyle amenities, expansive green areas, and advanced security systems, meeting the aspirations of modern homeowners and discerning investors. Whether analyzing price trends for Hero Homes Sector 104 or exploring customer feedback, Hero Homes The Palatial stands as a symbol of reliability, a smart investment choice, and a refined living experience. More than just a home, it is a progressive community where luxury meets practicality, offering an elevated lifestyle in a dynamic urban corridor."}', '{"The project is spread over an area of 7.13 acres.","The Palatial by Hero Homes Sector 104 housing society has 5 towers with 40 floors.","Direct Dwarka Expressway Access to Delhi & IGI.","Car-Free Surface Zones for peaceful living.","Double-Height Tower Entrances for grand welcomes.","Miyawaki Forest Pathway promoting wellness.","All-Season Temperature-Controlled Pool.","Smart Home Automation with digital living features.","5-Tier Security System for complete safety.","70% Green & Open Spaces for serene living.","Hero Homes The Palatial."}', '{"7-Star Ultra-Luxury Clubhouse.","State-of-the-Art Fitness Center.","Infinity-Edge Swimming Pool.","Designer Landscaped Gardens.","Kids'' Play Zone.","Kids'' Play Zone.","Jogging & Cycling Tracks.","High-Speed Elevators.","Grand Multipurpose Hall.","24×7 Security & CCTV.","Dedicated Basement Parking.","Cricket Practice Nets.","Smart Homes with VRV Air-Conditioning.","Hero Homes The Palatial."}',
   '{"in this Project.","Positioned along the rapidly developing Dwarka Expressway, the project ensures excellent connectivity to IGI Airport, Delhi, and major commercial hubs.","With the area experiencing robust infrastructure growth, the property appreciation potential is strong, making it ideal for both end-users and long-term investors.","Offering the perfect mix of affordability, premium features, and brand trust, Hero Homes The Palatial clearly stands out in Gurgaon''s luxury real estate market.","Prime Location Connectivity - Strategically positioned on the Dwarka Expressway, ensuring quick access to Delhi, IGI Airport, and key business hubs.","Hero Group Legacy of Trust - Developed by Hero Realty, the real estate arm of the renowned Hero Group, ensuring quality, transparency, and reliability.","High Appreciation Potential - Located in Sector 104, Gurgaon, one of the city''s fastest-growing corridors with strong property value growth.","Luxury with Smart Living - Offering modern smart homes, premium interiors, and over 50 world-class amenities designed for elevated living."}', '{"The site promises strong future development potential , backed by rapid infrastructure growth in the area.","Sector 104, Gurugram, The Rising Star in Real Estate.","Dwarka Expressway: Direct Access.","IGI Airport: 20 minutes away.","Gurgaon Railway Station: 4 km distance.","Medanta Medicity: 6 km away.","Ambience Mall: 18 minutes travel time.","Cyber Hub: 25 minutes travel time.","NH-8: 15 minutes travel time."}', 'Discover thoughtfully designed residences at Hero Homes The Palatial , offering spacious layouts that balance comfort, elegance, and functionality',
   '{"/projects/hero-homes-the-palatial-luxurious-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway-gurugram/02.jpg","/projects/hero-homes-the-palatial-luxurious-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway-gurugram/04.webp","/projects/hero-homes-the-palatial-luxurious-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway-gurugram/05.jpg","/projects/hero-homes-the-palatial-luxurious-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway-gurugram/06.png","/projects/hero-homes-the-palatial-luxurious-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway-gurugram/07.jpg"}', true, false, 6, 'published',
   'Hero Homes The Palatial - Luxurious Apartments on Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram', 'Hero Homes The Palatial, located in Sector 104, Gurugram, is a new luxury offering by Hero Realty that redefines upscale urban living. Designed with a perfect')
