   '{"in this Project.","Investing in Indiabulls Estate and Club 104 offers unparalleled luxury and strong potential for high returns.","Strategically located in Sector 104, Gurgaon along the Dwarka Expressway , the project combines modern design, premium construction, and world-class amenities.","With spacious 3 & 4 BHK apartments, smart home features, and resort-style facilities, Indiabulls Estate and Club Sector 104 ensures a superior lifestyle.","Excellent connectivity to NH-8 , IGI Airport, and key business hubs makes it highly attractive for both homeowners and investors.","With Indiabulls Estate and Club 104 Gurgaon , buyers gain a secure, high-value investment in one of Gurgaon''s most sought-after locations.","Prime location on Dwarka Expressway.","Proximity to key business hubs and the airport."}', '{"Proximity to IGI Airport.","Easy access to NH-8 and NH-48.","Close to Cyber City and MG Road.","Near reputed schools and hospitals.","Shopping malls and entertainment hubs within reach.","Upcoming metro corridor enhancing connectivity.","Strategic location near Delhi border.","Surrounded by premium residential developments.","Indiabulls Estate and Club 104 enjoys a prime location on the Dwarka Expressway , offering seamless connectivity to key destinations across Gurgaon and Delhi NCR.","Residents benefit from quick access to NH-8 , IGI Airport, Cyber City , and major business hubs, making daily commutes effortless."}', '3 BHK apartments with spacious layouts and private terraces. 4 BHK units offering expansive living spaces. 3 BHK 4 BHK Indiabulls Estate and Club',
   '{"/projects/indiabulls-estate-and-club-104-gurgaon-luxury-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway/02.jpg","/projects/indiabulls-estate-and-club-104-gurgaon-luxury-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway/03.png","/projects/indiabulls-estate-and-club-104-gurgaon-luxury-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway/04.jpg","/projects/indiabulls-estate-and-club-104-gurgaon-luxury-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway/06.png"}', false, false, 7, 'published',
