  ('ss-camasa-sector-90-gurgaon', 'ss-camasa-sector-90-gurgaon', 'SS Camasa', 'Spacious 4 BHK homes with a grand clubhouse',
   'SS Group', 'New Gurgaon', 'Sector 90', 'Gurugram',
   'residential', 'Apartment', 'new-launch', '4 BHK',
   36100000, 36100000, 7,
   4, 512, 'September 2031', null,
   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","SS Camasa Sector 90 by SS Group is a premium residential development in the heart of New Gurgaon. Spread across 7 acres, SS Camasa Gurgaon offers ultra-luxurious SS Camasa 4 BHK apartments with a super area of approximately 2,530 sq. ft. The project features low-density planning with only 512 units across 4 towers rising up to 32 floors, ensuring privacy and exclusivity.","Each apartment is thoughtfully designed with Italian marble flooring, private lift access, and panoramic Aravalli-facing balconies. Over 75% open space, landscaped gardens, a swimming pool, EV charging stations, and a world-class SS Camasa clubhouse emphasize wellness, green living, and lifestyle excellence. Strategically located along the Dwarka Expressway, SS Camasa Sector 90 ensures seamless connectivity to NH-8, Pataudi Road, IGI Airport, and Cyber City. These SS Camasa luxury residences offer the perfect blend of design, location, and investment potential."}', '{"The project is spread over an area of 7 acres.","4 high-rise towers with 32 floors each.","There are around 512 units on offer.","Over 75% green and open landscaped area.","Aravalli-facing units for unobstructed views.","Italian marble flooring and smart layout.","Private lifts and double-height drop-off lobby.","Earthquake-resistant RCC structure.","Gated complex with 24×7 security surveillance.","Excellent connectivity via Dwarka Expressway."}', '{"Grand SS Camasa clubhouse.","Infinity-edge swimming pool & kids'' pool.","Fully-equipped modern gymnasium.","Yoga & meditation deck.","Jogging and cycling track.","Indoor & outdoor sports courts.","Mini theater and AV room.","EV charging stations.","Landscaped gardens and seating zones.","Pet-friendly and wheelchair-accessible layout."}',
   '{"in this Project.","SS Camasa Gurgaon offers a perfect blend of luxury, space, and connectivity in one of the fastest-growing sectors of Gurgaon.","Featuring SS Camasa 4 BHK apartments with premium interiors and low-density planning, it ensures privacy and modern comfort.","The project, part of the SS Camasa luxury residences , includes world-class amenities such as the SS Camasa clubhouse , landscaped gardens, and wellness zones.","Developed by the trusted SS Group , it promises transparency, quality construction, and timely possession.","With excellent connectivity and strong growth potential, SS Camasa Sector 90 delivers both superior lifestyle and attractive long-term investment value.","Strategic location near Dwarka Expressway.","Premium SS Camasa luxury residences."}', '{"Easy access to Dwarka Expressway.","5 min from Pataudi Road.","10 min from NH-8 and SPR.","20 min to Cyber City & Udyog Vihar.","30 min drive to IGI Airport.","Close to hospitals, malls & schools.","Upcoming metro connectivity nearby.","SS Linden Floors Sector 84 enjoys a prime location in well-developed Sector 84, Gurgaon, offering excellent connectivity to residential and commercial hubs.","Positioned near NH-8 and Dwarka Expressway, SS Linden Floors Gurgaon ensures easy access to Delhi, IGI Airport, and central Gurgaon.","The neighborhood features reputed schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and office complexes, making daily life convenient and well-rounded."}', 'Check out the detailed layout in the SS Camasa floor plan . 4 BHK SS Camasa',
   '{"/projects/ss-camasa-sector-90-gurgaon/02.jpg","/projects/ss-camasa-sector-90-gurgaon/03.webp","/projects/ss-camasa-sector-90-gurgaon/04.jpg","/projects/ss-camasa-sector-90-gurgaon/05.jpg","/projects/ss-camasa-sector-90-gurgaon/06.png","/projects/ss-camasa-sector-90-gurgaon/07.jpg"}', true, false, 8, 'published',
   'SS Camasa Sector 90 Gurgaon | Luxury 4 BHK Apartments with Clubhouse & Modern Amenities', 'Discover SS Camasa Sector 90 Gurgaon - premium 4 BHK luxury residences with clubhouse, lush landscapes, competitive price, floor plans, brochure, and booking info.')
