   12300000, 12300000, 8,
   null, null, null, null,
   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","SS Cendana Sector 83 Gurgaon offers a serene and luxurious living experience in the heart of New Gurgaon. Developed by the trusted SS Group , the project features premium SS Cendana 3 BHK apartments designed for comfort, elegance, and modern urban living. With thoughtfully planned layouts, SS Cendana luxury residences blend aesthetics with functionality, ensuring ample natural light, ventilation, and spacious interiors.","Set within a gated community with lush landscaping and top-tier amenities, SS Cendana Gurgaon provides seamless connectivity to NH-8, Dwarka Expressway, and key business hubs. These SS Cendana 3 BHK homes are perfect for families seeking privacy, refined living, and easy access to schools, hospitals, and entertainment zones. With flexible SS Cendana payment plan options, early SS Cendana booking , and competitive SS Cendana price , SS Cendana Sector 83 promises both comfort and long-term investment value in Gurgaon''s evolving luxury real estate market."}', '{"Premium 3 BHK luxury residences in Sector 83, Gurgaon.","The project is spread over an area of 8 acres.","The Project offers 10 high rise towers.","Seamless access to NH-8 and Dwarka Expressway.","Located near commercial hubs and educational institutions.","Contemporary architecture with lush landscaped greens.","Low-density project with premium specifications.","High-speed elevators & advanced security system.","Clubhouse, pool, gym, and indoor game zones.","Smart home features and modular kitchen fittings."}', '{"Clubhouse with multipurpose hall.","Swimming pool with kids'' pool section.","Landscaped parks and jogging tracks.","Fully-equipped gymnasium.","Indoor games: carrom, chess, pool.","Yoga and meditation zone.","Kids'' play area and activity corner.","High-speed elevators and 24x7 security.","Amphitheatre and open-air seating.","Visitor parking and power backup."}',
   '{"in this Project.","SS Cendana Gurgaon presents a perfect blend of luxury, location, and lifestyle, making it an ideal choice for both investors and homeowners.","Developed by the trusted SS Group , the project offers thoughtfully designed SS Cendana 3 BHK apartments and premium SS Cendana luxury residences.","Buyers can explore the SS Cendana floor plan , download the SS Cendana brochure , and opt for flexible SS Cendana payment plan options.","SS Cendana Sector 83 promises strong appreciation and excellent rental potential.","Prime location in New Gurgaon.","High future growth potential.","Trusted brand: SS Group."}', '{"2 mins from NH-8.","10 mins from Dwarka Expressway.","15 mins from Hero Honda Chowk.","20 mins from Cyber City.","5 mins from proposed ISBT & Metro.","Nearby schools: DPS, RPS, St.","Close to Medanta & Artemis Hospitals.","Located in SS Cendana Sector 83 , SS Cendana Gurgaon enjoys excellent connectivity to all major destinations in the city and NCR.","The project''s strategic location, near NH-8 and Dwarka Expressway, makes it highly accessible."}', 'Explore SS Cendana floor plan to view efficiently designed 3 BHK layouts with spacious living areas, balconies, and modern kitchens. 3 BHK + Study SS Cendana',
   '{"/projects/ss-cendana-sector-83-gurgaon/01.webp","/projects/ss-cendana-sector-83-gurgaon/02.webp","/projects/ss-cendana-sector-83-gurgaon/04.jpg","/projects/ss-cendana-sector-83-gurgaon/06.png","/projects/ss-cendana-sector-83-gurgaon/08.webp"}', false, true, 9, 'published',
   'SS Cendana Sector 83 Gurgaon | Luxury 3 BHK Residences | Price, Brochure & Floor Plan', 'Discover SS Cendana luxury residences in Sector 83, Gurgaon. Spacious 3 BHK homes with premium amenities. Check price, brochure, floor plan, booking & payment plan.')
