   'SS Group', 'New Gurgaon', 'Sector 84', 'Gurugram',
   'residential', 'Independent Floor', 'under-construction', '4 & 5 BHK',
   48600000, 48600000, 27,
   30, 155, null, null,
   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","SS Linden Floors Sector 84 offers a premium lifestyle through low-rise 4 BHK independent floors and 5 BHK independent floors in New Gurgaon. Developed by the trusted SS Group , this gated community blends privacy, elegance, and exclusivity for discerning buyers. With a limited number of residences, SS Linden Floors Gurgaon ensures peaceful surroundings, ample natural light, and thoughtfully designed layouts for everyday comfort.","Each unit features high-end finishes, private balconies, and modern utility spaces, making SS Linden Floors luxury residences ideal for families seeking independence with sophistication. Strategically located near Dwarka Expressway, NH-8, reputed schools, hospitals, and commercial hubs, the project offers both lifestyle convenience and strong investment potential. Prospective buyers can explore the SS Linden Floors brochure , floor plan , and photos to experience the premium offerings. With landscaped greens, world-class amenities, and a well-established neighborhood, SS Linden Floors 4 BHK independent floors promise not just a home, but a remarkable lifestyle upgrade in Gurgaon."}', '{"Spread over an area of 27 acres.","Offers 30 towers, with 4 floors each and 155 units.","Developed by SS Group with a trusted legacy.","Exclusive floors with private access.","Gated community with 3-tier security.","Low-rise independent 4 BHK floors and 5 BHK floors.","Italian marble flooring & modular kitchen.","Just 2 apartments per floor.","Near Dwarka Expressway and NH-8.","Ideal for both end-users & investors.","SS Linden Floors."}', '{"Dedicated basement car parking.","Lush landscaped gardens.","Power backup for all units.","High-speed elevators.","CCTV surveillance & intercom.","Gated entry with security cabin.","Clubhouse with indoor games.","Open-air gymnasium.","Grand Multipurpose Hall.","Kids'' play area.","Rainwater harvesting system.","SS Linden Floors."}',
   '{"in this Project.","SS Linden Floors Sector 84 is an ideal investment for homebuyers seeking luxury residences and privacy in Gurgaon''s New Gurgaon area.","The project''s low-density design and thoughtful planning provide exclusivity and modern living standards.","For discerning investors, SS Linden Floors 4 BHK independent floors combine elegance, convenience, and enduring investment potential.","Prime location with high connectivity.","Reputed developer with timely delivery.","Premium specifications and fittings.","High resale and rental potential."}', '{"2 mins to Dwarka Expressway.","5 mins from NH-8.","15 mins to IGI Airport.","Close to Vatika Town Square.","Nearby RPS International School.","Near healthcare centers like Aarvy Hospital.","Upcoming metro station within reach.","SS Linden Floors Sector 84 enjoys a prime location in well-developed Sector 84, Gurgaon, offering excellent connectivity to residential and commercial hubs.","Positioned near NH-8 and Dwarka Expressway, SS Linden Floors Gurgaon ensures easy access to Delhi, IGI Airport, and central Gurgaon.","The neighborhood features reputed schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and office complexes, making daily life convenient and well-rounded."}', 'Discover spacious 4 BHK and 5 BHK layouts with functional zoning and natural ventilation. 4 BHK 5 BHK SS Linden Floors',
   '{"/projects/ss-linden-floors-sector-84-gurgaon/01.jpg","/projects/ss-linden-floors-sector-84-gurgaon/02.jpg","/projects/ss-linden-floors-sector-84-gurgaon/03.webp","/projects/ss-linden-floors-sector-84-gurgaon/04.jpg","/projects/ss-linden-floors-sector-84-gurgaon/05.jpg","/projects/ss-linden-floors-sector-84-gurgaon/06.jpg","/projects/ss-linden-floors-sector-84-gurgaon/07.png","/projects/ss-linden-floors-sector-84-gurgaon/08.jpg","/projects/ss-linden-floors-sector-84-gurgaon/09.jpg"}', false, false, 10, 'published',
   'SS Linden Floors Sector 84 Gurgaon | Luxury 4 BHK Independent Floors & Residences', 'Explore SS Linden Floors Sector 84 Gurgaon offering luxury 4 BHK independent floors with modern amenities. Check price, floor plan, photos, brochure & reviews today!')
