   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","Situated in the heart of HCBS Sector 102 Gurgaon , HCBS Twin Horizon Gurgaon is a premium residential project featuring well-designed 3 and 4 BHK apartments. Strategically located just off the Dwarka Expressway, it ensures smooth connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, and major business hubs across Gurugram. Developed by HCBS Builder , the project combines modern urban living with affordability, offering residents a perfect balance of comfort, convenience, and lifestyle.","Surrounded by landscaped greenery and a peaceful environment, HCBS Twin Horizon Sector 102 Gurgaon provides a serene retreat while keeping essential city facilities within easy reach. The project boasts world-class amenities, including a clubhouse, gym, children''s play areas, jogging tracks, and open spaces, fostering both recreation and community living. With reputed schools, hospitals, malls, and work hubs nearby, it caters to families seeking a secure, well-connected, and future-ready home. HCBS Twin Horizon stands out as a smart investment with long-term appreciation potential in HCBS Sector 102 ."}', '{"Located in HCBS Sector 102, Gurgaon, near Dwarka Expressway.","Spacious 3 & 4 BHK configurations by HCBS Builder.","The project is spread over an area of 5.29 acres.","There are around 268 units on offer.","Close to IGI Airport and Dwarka Metro.","HCBS Twin Horizon Sector 102, Gurgaon housing society has 2 towers with 34 floors.","Well-designed layouts with proper ventilation.","Gated community with 3-tier security by HCBS Builder.","Dedicated parking and visitor space.","Schools, hospitals, and malls within 5 km radius of HCBS Twin Horizon Sector 102.","HCBS Twin Horizon."}', '{"Modern Clubhouse.","Fully equipped Gymnasium.","Children''s Play Area.","Jogging & Walking Tracks.","Multipurpose Community Hall.","24x7 Water & Power Backup.","CCTV Surveillance.","Yoga & Meditation Zones.","Senior Citizen Sit-Outs.","Landscaped Gardens.","HCBS Twin Horizon."}',
   '{"in this Project.","Situated in HCBS Sector 102 Gurgaon , the project enjoys excellent connectivity to Dwarka Expressway, Delhi, IGI Airport, and major business hubs.","Thoughtfully designed 3 and 4 BHK apartments provide spacious layouts, natural ventilation, and abundant light.","With upcoming metro access and well-planned infrastructure, HCBS Twin Horizon promises both immediate comfort and strong future appreciation.","Its green spaces, clubhouse, gym, and children''s areas ensure a complete, family-friendly residential experience in Gurugram''s rapidly growing Sector 102.","Strategic location in HCBS Sector 102 with infrastructure development.","Luxurious pricing for premium amenities by HCBS Builder.","Ideal for end-use & rental income."}', '{"Just off Dwarka Expressway.","5 mins from Basai Railway Station.","15 mins from IGI Airport.","10 mins from Dwarka Metro Station.","5 mins to Narayana Superspeciality Hospital.","Nearby top schools like GEMS International School.","Close to malls like AMB Selfie Square.","Excellent road connectivity to NH-8 & SPR.","HCBS Twin Horizon Sector 102 Gurgaon enjoys a prime location in HCBS Sector 102 Gurgaon , offering unmatched connectivity and convenience.","The area is surrounded by reputed schools, hospitals, shopping centers, and entertainment zones, ensuring a self-sufficient lifestyle for families."}', 'Explore 3 & 4 BHK well-optimized HCBS Twin Horizon floor plans for smart living. 3 BHK 4 BHK HCBS Twin Horizon',
   '{"/projects/hcbs-twin-horizon-sector-102-gurgaon/03.webp","/projects/hcbs-twin-horizon-sector-102-gurgaon/04.webp","/projects/hcbs-twin-horizon-sector-102-gurgaon/05.webp"}', false, false, 11, 'published',
   'HCBS Twin Horizon Sector 102 Gurgaon | Luxury 3 & 4 BHK Apartments with Modern Amenities', 'Discover HCBS Twin Horizon Gurgaon in Sector 102—premium 3 & 4 BHK homes with world-class amenities, lush greenery, and excellent Dwarka Expressway connectivity.')
