   8, 531, null, null,
   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","BPTP Gaia Residences Sector 102 Gurgaon is a luxurious residential community located within the integrated Amstoria Township , offering serene and modern living. Developed by the reputed BPTP Group , the project combines contemporary comfort with lush greenery and thoughtfully designed spaces. Spread across landscaped surroundings, BPTP Gaia Residences Gurgaon features spacious 3 BHK apartments with intelligent BPTP Gaia Residences floor plans and premium specifications.","Strategically positioned just off the Dwarka Expressway, the project provides excellent connectivity to IGI Airport, Delhi, and Gurugram''s business hubs. With a focus on security, privacy, and community living, it offers wide internal roads, dedicated parking, and advanced security systems. Residents can enjoy lifestyle amenities such as a clubhouse, parks, fitness areas, jogging tracks, and recreational zones for all age groups. From BPTP Gaia Residences brochure insights to photos and layouts, the project reflects modern design, eco-friendly features, and long-term appreciation potential, making it an ideal choice for families and investors alike."}', '{"The project is spread over an area of 1.68 acres.","3 BHK spacious Apartments.","Located in Sector 102 Gurgaon near Dwarka Expressway.","There are around 531 units on offer.","BPTP Gaia Residences at Amstoria 102, Gurgaon housing society has 8 towers.","Clubhouse with gym, pool, and indoor games.","24x7 security with boom barriers and CCTV.","Close to schools, hospitals, and retail hubs.","Dedicated stilt parking for each unit.","High-quality construction and branded fittings.","BPTP Gaia Residences."}', '{"Landscaped central park.","Modern fitness center.","Kids'' play zones.","Jogging and cycling tracks.","Indoor games like billiards & table tennis.","Power backup and high-speed elevators.","Gated community with surveillance.","Clubhouse with swimming pool.","BPTP Gaia Residences."}',
   '{"in this Project.","BPTP Gaia Residences Gurgaon is a premium residential project offering the perfect combination of luxury and investment potential.","Located in a secure, gated township, it features spacious 3 BHK apartments with modern amenities, landscaped gardens, and eco-friendly spaces.","BPTP Gaia Residences Sector 102 Gurgaon provides excellent connectivity to Dwarka Expressway, IGI Airport, Delhi, and Gurugram''s key business hubs.","Designed for families and investors alike, the project ensures peaceful living, high appreciation potential, and superior infrastructure.","Prime location on Dwarka Expressway.","Reputed developer with successful legacy.","Modern amenities for holistic lifestyle."}', '{"15 mins to IGI Airport.","Near NH-8 & Hero Honda Chowk.","Close to Dwarka Metro Line (Upcoming).","Surrounded by reputed schools and hospitals.","Easy access to Cyber Hub and Golf Course Road.","Located within Amstoria township.","5 mins from DPS and Euro International School.","Shopping arcades nearby like Ansal Plaza.","BPTP Gaia Residences Sector 102 Gurgaon is a premium residential enclave strategically located just off the Dwarka Expressway.","Offering seamless connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, and major business hubs, BPTP Gaia Residences Gurgaon is ideal for daily commuters and frequent travelers."}', 'Thoughtfully designed 3 BHK layouts with spacious balconies. Vastu-compliant floor plans for energy efficiency. Open-plan kitchens and attached bathrooms for each bedroom.',
   '{"/projects/bptp-gaia-residences-sector-102-gurgaon-luxury-3-bhk-apartments/02.webp","/projects/bptp-gaia-residences-sector-102-gurgaon-luxury-3-bhk-apartments/03.webp","/projects/bptp-gaia-residences-sector-102-gurgaon-luxury-3-bhk-apartments/04.webp","/projects/bptp-gaia-residences-sector-102-gurgaon-luxury-3-bhk-apartments/05.jpg"}', false, true, 12, 'published',
