e technology integration.","Central Park 104 Gurgaon."}', '{"Certain services such as security, fitness center access, and concierge support are included in the residence ownership experience.","Indoor games and recreation room.","Swimming pool with kids'' zone.","Fully equipped gymnasium.","Senior citizen seating zones.","Yoga and meditation area.","Landscaped gardens and green spaces.","Multipurpose hall for events.","Cafeteria and lounge.","Power backup and water supply systems.","Cricket/net practice area.","Central Park 104 Gurgaon."}',
   '{"in this Project.","Central Park 104 Gurgaon offers a rare combination of luxury, connectivity, and investment potential.","Strategically located on Dwarka Expressway, it provides seamless access to Delhi, IGI Airport, and major commercial hubs.","With eco-friendly design, premium amenities, and smart homes, the project promises superior living standards.","Prime Dwarka Expressway location with Delhi & IGI Airport connectivity.","Modern 3, 4 BHK & Studio apartments with premium layouts.","Strong capital appreciation potential in Sector 104 Gurgaon.","World-class amenities like clubhouse, pool, and gym."}', '{"Prime Dwarka Expressway location with Delhi & IGI Airport connectivity.","Modern 3, 4 BHK & Studio apartments with premium layouts.","Strong capital appreciation potential in Sector 104 Gurgaon.","World-class amenities like clubhouse, pool, and gym.","Eco-friendly design with green spaces and rainwater harvesting.","Trusted developer with timely delivery and quality construction.","Its prime location ensures easy access to corporate offices, shopping centers, schools, and healthcare facilities, making daily commutes convenient.","Surrounded by rapidly developing infrastructure, Central Park Sector 104 combines urban convenience with a tranquil living environment.","This makes it an ideal choice for families, professionals, and investors seeking both lifestyle and long-term appreciation."}', 'Discover the thoughtfully designed Central Park 104 floor plans featuring luxurious 3, 4 BHK & Studio apartments , layouts optimized for space, comfort, and modern living.',
   '{"/projects/central-park-104-gurgaon-premium-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway/03.webp","/projects/central-park-104-gurgaon-premium-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway/04.webp","/projects/central-park-104-gurgaon-premium-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway/05.webp"}', false, false, 13, 'published',
