   8334000, 116700000, 10.43,
   null, null, null, null,
   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","AIPL Joy District Sector 88 Gurgaon is an iconic commercial destination that brings a new dimension to high-street retail in New Gurgaon. Spread across a prime 75-meter-wide corner plot, this development by Advance India Projects Limited (AIPL) offers a mix of high-street retail shops, double-height showrooms, anchor stores, food courts, and premium office suites. The low-rise, open-air architectural design ensures excellent frontage, visibility, and high customer engagement.","Crafted by renowned global architects, the project is equipped with modern infrastructure and thoughtfully planned spaces to meet the needs of retailers, investors, and brands. Its strategic location provides seamless connectivity to Dwarka Expressway , NH-48, and other major roads, ensuring consistent footfall from surrounding residential and commercial hubs. With the rising demand for organized retail in Gurgaon, AIPL Joy District stands out as a future-ready investment opportunity. Detailed layouts can be explored through the official AIPL Joy District brochure and floor plans."}', '{"Double-height retail shops on ground and first levels.","Expansive 500+ ft frontage ensuring maximum visibility.","Food courts with vibrant rooftop dining.","Modern co-working and office suites.","High-speed elevators and escalators for convenience.","Upcoming metro station is just 5 minutes away.","Prime frontage on a 75m wide sector road.","Prime frontage on a 75m wide sector road.","Professional leasing and investment support by AIPL.","Spread across 10.43 acres with low-density planning.","AIPL Joy District Gurgaon."}', '{"24x7 multi-tier security with surveillance.","Central landscaped courtyard with seating zones.","Spacious surface and basement parking.","Reliable power backup.","Fast elevators and smooth escalator access.","Wi-Fi-enabled common spaces.","Fully air-conditioned public areas.","Food court with diverse dining options.","Advanced fire detection & sprinkler systems.","AIPL Joy District Gurgaon."}',
   '{"in this Project.","Nestled in New Gurgaon''s high-demand corridor, the project enjoys excellent connectivity via Dwarka Expressway, NH-48, and the upcoming metro station.","With limited commercial supply and a rapidly expanding residential population, the development ensures consistent footfall and sustained business opportunities.","Located in New Gurgaon''s fastest-growing sector.","High visibility and 500+ ft wide frontage.","Limited supply of high-street commercial space.","Attracts retail, F&B, and office tenants.","Near major highways and metro routes."}', '{"5 mins from Dwarka Expressway.","10 mins to NH-48 & Hero Honda Chowk.","Near proposed metro station.","Adjacent to DLF Garden City & Vatika Homes.","Surrounded by 10,000+ families.","Easy access to Pataudi Road & SPR.","20 mins to IGI Airport via Dwarka E-way.","Close to schools, hospitals & malls.","Situated in Sector 88, AIPL Joy District Gurgaon holds a strategic spot within New Gurgaon''s thriving commercial hub.","Positioned on a 75-meter-wide road, the project offers maximum visibility and easy accessibility."}', 'Explore flexible layouts tailored for retail, food court, and office use in the AIPL Joy District floor plan. Shops Shops Shops Shops Shops AIPL Joy District Gurgaon',
   '{"/projects/aipl-joy-district-gurgaon/01.jpg","/projects/aipl-joy-district-gurgaon/02.jpg","/projects/aipl-joy-district-gurgaon/04.jpg"}', true, true, 15, 'published',
   'AIPL Joy District Gurgaon', 'Explore flexible layouts tailored for retail, food court, and office use in the AIPL Joy District floor plan.')
