   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","Reach The BAZARIA 68 Gurgaon is a premium commercial project strategically located in Sector 68 Gurgaon along the Southern Peripheral Road (SPR) and close to Dwarka Expressway . Designed as a futuristic shopping and business destination, it offers a perfect blend of retail, F&B, entertainment, and SCO plots in Sector 68 .","With excellent connectivity to Delhi, Sohna Road, Golf Course Extension, and NH-48, Reach The BAZARIA is set to become a new landmark in New Gurgaon. The project introduces a unique concept of high-street retail, offices, and SCO spaces under one roof, making it an ideal choice for investors and businesses. Backed by the Reach Group , it guarantees modern design, efficient layouts, and high rental yields. With its new launch , Reach The BAZARIA sector 68 redefines the shopping and lifestyle experience for Gurgaon''s urban population"}', '{"Prime location in Reach The BAZARIA 68 Gurgaon.","High visibility on Southern Peripheral Road (SPR).","Close proximity to Dwarka Expressway and Sohna Road.","Mix of retail, entertainment, and SCO plot in Sector 68.","Spread across 6 acres of land.","The project offers 125 Units.","Ample parking and pedestrian-friendly pathways.","Surrounded by premium residential catchments.","Backed by the reputed Reach Group.","Long-term investment potential with excellent returns.","Reach The BAZARIA."}', '{"Spacious parking facilities.","High-speed elevators and escalators.","24/7 power backup and water supply.","Advanced fire-fighting systems.","CCTV surveillance and security staff.","Modern restrooms and waiting lounges.","Dedicated loading/unloading bays.","Wi-Fi-enabled commercial spaces.","Green landscaped surroundings.","Multipurpose event spaces.","Reach The BAZARIA."}',
   '{"in this Project.","Reach The BAZARIA 68 Gurgaon presents a unique opportunity to invest in premium commercial property within a rapidly growing corridor.","The project offers retail shops, SCO plots in Sector 68 , and lifestyle zones designed with modern layouts to maximize visibility and footfall.","Prime SPR & Dwarka Expressway location.","Growing footfall from nearby residential hubs.","Modern Reach The BAZARIA floor plan.","Excellent brand visibility.","Developed by trusted Reach Group."}', '{"On Southern Peripheral Road (SPR).","Close to Dwarka Expressway.","Easy access to Sohna Road and NH-48.","Well-connected to Golf Course Extension Road.","30 minutes to IGI Airport.","Surrounded by luxury housing projects.","Upcoming metro connectivity.","Near corporate hubs and IT parks.","Located in Sector 68 Gurgaon , Reach The BAZARIA offers unmatched accessibility and visibility for businesses.","The project benefits from a strong residential catchment with premium societies, schools, and hospitals in close proximity."}', 'The Reach The BAZARIA floor plan includes flexible layouts for retail, SCO, and entertainment spaces. Efficient space utilization for high customer footfall. Wide corridors and open-air high-street retail concept.',
   '{"/projects/reach-the-bazaria-68-gurgaon-premium-sco-plots-retail-spaces/01.jpg","/projects/reach-the-bazaria-68-gurgaon-premium-sco-plots-retail-spaces/03.jpg"}', false, false, 18, 'published',
