   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","Reach Buzz 114 is a landmark commercial development in Sector 114 Gurgaon , strategically located along Dwarka Expressway. Designed for the future of retail and business, this project offers SCO plots , high-street retail, office spaces, and lifestyle zones. With excellent connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, and major business districts, Reach Buzz 114 Gurgaon ensures maximum visibility and customer engagement.","This new launch is set to redefine urban retail with pedestrian-friendly boulevards, wide frontage, and a modern architectural layout. Whether you are looking to invest in SCO plots or open your brand outlet, Reach Buzz 114 guarantees long-term growth, strong returns, and a thriving business ecosystem. Explore details via the official Reach Buzz brochure , floor plan , and photos to understand why this project is one of the most awaited commercial destinations in New Gurgaon."}', '{"Prime commercial location on Dwarka Expressway.","Freehold SCO plots with high investment potential.","Reach Buzz 114 Gurgaon is spread over 5.14 acres.","The Project offers 60 units.","Upcoming metro connectivity nearby.","Surrounded by premium residential hubs.","Developed by the trusted Reach Group.","Ample parking space for visitors & owners.","Seamless connectivity to Delhi & IGI Airport.","Part of a growing retail and lifestyle hub.","Reach Buzz 114."}', '{"High-street retail spaces with open-air design.","24x7 CCTV surveillance & multi-level security.","Ample surface and basement parking.","Power backup for uninterrupted operations.","Wi-Fi-enabled public zones.","Central landscaped plaza with sit-outs.","Food courts & fine dining options.","Modern fire safety and detection systems.","High-speed elevators & escalators.","Energy-efficient infrastructure.","Reach Buzz 114."}',
   '{"in this Project.","Reach Buzz 114 Gurgaon is a premium commercial hub that combines strategic location, modern design, and high investment potential.","Situated along Dwarka Expressway , it enjoys seamless connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, and nearby residential sectors.","Featuring SCO plots, retail outlets, food courts, and office spaces, the project caters to businesses and investors seeking high visibility and steady footfall.","With thoughtfully designed Reach Buzz floor plans , pedestrian-friendly zones, and ample open spaces, the development ensures maximum customer engagement.","Freehold SCO plots.","High appreciation potential.","Strong rental yields."}', '{"5 mins from Dwarka Expressway.","10 mins from IGI Airport.","15 mins from Cyber City Gurgaon.","20 mins from Connaught Place Delhi.","Near premium residential societies.","Close to top schools & hospitals.","Seamless metro & road connectivity.","Located in Sector 114 Gurgaon , Reach Buzz 114 enjoys exceptional connectivity to Dwarka Expressway , Delhi, IGI Airport, and major business districts.","Its strategic position ensures easy access for customers, employees, and investors, enhancing footfall and business potential."}', 'Detailed Reach Buzz floor plan available for SCO plots, retail shops & office suites. Flexible layouts for branding & customization. Optimized designs for high visibility & footfall.',
   '{"/projects/reach-buzz-114-premium-sco-plots-in-sector-114-gurgaon/03.jpg","/projects/reach-buzz-114-premium-sco-plots-in-sector-114-gurgaon/04.jpg"}', false, true, 19, 'published',
