  ('the-omaxe-state-sector-19b-dwarka', 'the-omaxe-state-sector-19b-dwarka', 'The Omaxe State', 'Delhi''s sports-led retail destination',
   'Omaxe Limited', 'Dwarka, New Delhi', 'Sector 19B', 'New Delhi',
   'commercial', 'Retail & Sports Complex', 'under-construction', 'Retail, Shops & Food Court',
   30000000, 30000000, 50.4,
   null, null, null, 'DLRERA2024P0003',
   '{"I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","I authorize company representatives to Call, SMS, Email or WhatsApp me about its products and offers.This consent overrides any registration for DNC/NDNC.","Welcome to The Omaxe State , a landmark development in Sector 19B, Dwarka , featuring India''s first integrated multi-sports and cultural complex alongside premium commercial and retail spaces. Conceptualized under a Public-Private Partnership (PPP) between DDA and Omaxe Group , this pioneering project is set to redefine the future of real estate and entertainment infrastructure in Delhi-NCR. Spread across 50.4 acres , the development houses a cricket and football stadium, state-of-the-art indoor sports arenas, a 7-screen multiplex, 5-star hotel and club, and hybrid retail spaces, creating a dynamic hub for sports, lifestyle, and business.","Backed by RERA approval (RERA No. DLRERA2024P0003), The Omaxe State offers a high-footfall investment opportunity supported by massive infrastructure growth and government initiatives. Its strategic location near the Dwarka Expressway, IGI Airport, and Yashobhoomi Convention Centre, along with a catchment area of over 30 lakh residents, ensures unmatched connectivity and demand. Omaxe Sector 19B Dwarka isn''t just a property it''s a future-ready ecosystem that blends sports, retail, entertainment, hospitality, and investment opportunities in one iconic destination."}', '{"India''s first retail + sports hub.","PPP model with DDA.","40,000+ capacity stadium.","Olympic pool & indoor arena.","5-star club & hotel.","Multiplex & retail spaces.","RERA-approved (DLRERA2024P0003).","12% assured returns till possession.","Opposite 200-acre Bharat Vandana Park.","11 entry points with drop-offs.","The Omaxe State Sector 19B Dwarka."}', '{"24x7 CCTV surveillance for complete security.","On-site ATM and banking facilities.","Multi-level parking with ample capacity.","Uninterrupted power backup.","Diverse dining and café options.","High-speed elevators & escalators.","Fully air-conditioned retail & commercial spaces.","Dedicated first-floor food court.","Advanced fire safety & alarm systems.","7-screen multiplex for entertainment.","The Omaxe State Sector 19B Dwarka."}',
   '{"in this Project.","The Omaxe State.","stands as one of Delhi-NCR''s most ambitious commercial projects, combining government-supported infrastructure with private sector expertise.","The strategic Public-Private Partnership (PPP) model guarantees government-backed reliability.","It is located near the Diplomatic Enclave and a 159-acre golf course.","The development features a world-class blend of sports, retail, and hospitality.","This premium commercial location in Delhi is RERA-approved, offering transparent investment options.","The Dwarka region is experiencing a massive infrastructure boost."}', '{"Next to 200-acre Bharat Vandana Park.","Close to Yashobhoomi Convention Centre.","20 mins from IGI Airport.","25 mins to DLF Cyber Hub, Gurgaon.","20 mins from Rajouri Garden & Janak Puri.","30 mins to Paschim Vihar & Punjabi Bagh.","Near Diplomatic Enclave 2 & IT hubs.","Excellent connectivity to Dwarka Expressway & Metro.","Located in Omaxe Dwarka Sector 19 , this landmark development offers unmatched connectivity and modern infrastructure.","Positioned strategically along the Dwarka Expressway , it ensures seamless access to Delhi, Gurgaon, and IGI Airport within minutes."}', 'Detailed floor plans for hybrid retail, anchor stores, and entertainment zones are available for investors and retailers.',
   '{"/projects/the-omaxe-state-sector-19b-dwarka/01.jpg","/projects/the-omaxe-state-sector-19b-dwarka/02.jpg","/projects/the-omaxe-state-sector-19b-dwarka/03.jpg","/projects/the-omaxe-state-sector-19b-dwarka/04.webp","/projects/the-omaxe-state-sector-19b-dwarka/05.jpg","/projects/the-omaxe-state-sector-19b-dwarka/06.jpg","/projects/the-omaxe-state-sector-19b-dwarka/07.jpg","/projects/the-omaxe-state-sector-19b-dwarka/08.jpg"}', true, false, 20, 'published',
   'The Omaxe State Sector 19B Dwarka', 'Backed by RERA approval (RERA No. DLRERA2024P0003), The Omaxe State offers a high-footfall investment opportunity supported by massive infrastructure growth')
